      <PrimaryExemptPurposeTxt>OHAMAZING ART OF HEALING(OAH) IS A NON-PROFIT COMMUNITY ORGANIZATION THAT PROMOTES HEALTHY MIND,BODY,AND SPIRIT TO THOSE PEOPLE WHO ARE SUFFERING, HAVE SUFFERED , AND THOSE WHO HAVE LOST LOVED ONES TO CANCER.OAH PROVIDES HOLISTIC SERVICES AS ALTERNATIVE TREATMENTS FOR CANCER VERSUS CONVENTIONAL TREATMENTS.THE MISSION OF THIS ORGANIZATION IS TO FACILITATE COMMUNITY'S OVERALL WELLNESS,REDUCE STRESS, AND IMPROVE HEALTH AND PERSONAL GROWTH THROUGH KNOWLWDGE AND PRACTICES.</PrimaryExemptPurposeTxt>
      <ProgramSrvcAccomplishmentGrp>
        <DescriptionProgramSrvcAccomTxt>OAH IS DETERMINED TO EDUCATE PEOPLE ON HEALING THE BODY THROUGH HOLISTIC PRACTICES. OAH IS A SAFE AND CARING ENVIRONMENT FOR INDIVIDUALS TO NETWORK WITH OTHER SURVIVORS WHO CAN SHARE THEIR JOURNEY AS WELL AS THEIR HEALTH PRACTICES. GAINING KNOWLEDGE TO STRENGTHEN ONESELF IS HALF THE BATTLE. FEAR SHOULD NOT BE PART OF THE EQUATION IN CHOOSING THE RIGHT TREATMENT FOR CANCER. WE BELIEVE THAT WITH A BALANCED MIND,BODY,AND SPIRIT, PEOPLE CAN CREATE WELLNESS AND HEALING IN THEIR LIVES. OAH WELCOMES UNDERPRIVILEGED PATIENTS WHO CANNOT AFFORD ALTERNANTIVE MEDICINE.</DescriptionProgramSrvcAccomTxt>
